{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;No boundaries \u2014 only obstacles.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phrase reflects the spirit of <strong>Shade of Streets</strong> \u2014 a game about parkour, speed, and urban culture.<br>There is no predefined path \u2014 only your skills and desire to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City for parkour</strong> \u2014 move across rooftops, walls, and streets, finding your own routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of movement</strong> \u2014 from simple jumps to flips and acrobatic combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow motion</strong> \u2014 an impressive way to control tricks and perfect your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism and physics</strong> \u2014 feel every sprint, every landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 relax or chase new records, playing the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shade of Streets</strong> is a parkour experience where freedom comes first.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043000?t=1762231949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043000?t=1762231949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043000/2ff8b5f52438608fdf735e01516d02a4d595323c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762231949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043000/2ff8b5f52438608fdf735e01516d02a4d595323c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762231949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;No boundaries \u2014 only obstacles.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phrase reflects the spiri